{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip &amp; Skid through numerous obstacles placed by your friends in this physic-based multiplayer driving game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race, get points based on your position, pick an item, place it, repeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE EVERY ROUND UNIQUE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place obstacles in game, from simple props to animated weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple surfaces swapping items are available to transform the track and objects mid race (dirt, mud, ice, lava, ...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create complex shortcuts with simple objects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRIVE FULL SPEED</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cars behave differently to the surfaces they drive on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcade style physic-based driving: drift, boost, jump and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced tools to place obstacles simply and accurately with a controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 30 circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 50 obstacles to pick and place each round</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FRIENDS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players online or in local split-screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Editable rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun, colorful and simple visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note that this game is mostly <strong>multiplayer</strong>, and intended to be played with <i>friends</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can still play solo and train on all tracks, but it has no dedicated singleplayer.</p>","background":"https://store.aka